The objective of this lab is to create a secure, isolated, and highly visible environment for Red/Blue team exercises. The environment is designed to mirror a corporate network where the defender (Wazuh) has full visibility into the target (Windows) via advanced logging.


Infrastructure Design
The environment consists of three virtualized nodes interconnected via an isolated virtual network (Internal/Host-Only), preventing accidental traffic leakage to the host network.
Role                 OS                            Purpose
AttackerKali      Linux 2026.x                     Offensive toolset (Nmap, Metasploit, etc.)
TargetWindows     10/11 Home edition               For exploitation/persistenceDefender
Ubuntu Server     24.04                            Wazuh Manager & Indexer (SIEM)


